msgstr "काम दिखाएं"

#. chat, clickable line under a message (verb): shows its tool calls; {} is the summary of what they did
msgid "Show · {}"
msgstr "दिखाएं · {}"

#. Vim mode, the which-key panel: what the keys "<Space> b" do in the chat and the explorer
msgid "Show/hide explorer"
msgstr "एक्सप्लोरर दिखाएं/छिपाएं"

#. Keys (key context “Everywhere”): the name of a key's action, in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It the key hints along the bottom of the window.
msgid "Show/hide keybindings"
msgstr "शॉर्टकट बार दिखाएं/छिपाएं"

#. Vim mode, the which-key panel: what the keys "<Space> ?" do in the chat and the explorer
msgid "Show/hide keys"
msgstr "कीज़ दिखाएं/छिपाएं"

#. Keys (key context “Everywhere”): the name of a key's action, in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It hides the strip of waiting messages above the composer, or shows it again (the setting Show the queue).
msgid "Show/hide queue"
msgstr "कतार दिखाएं/छिपाएं"

#. Keys (key context “Everywhere”): the name of a key's action, in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It shows or hides the explorer (sidebar)
msgid "Show/hide sidebar"
msgstr "साइडबार दिखाएं/छिपाएं"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Archived agents” saying what it does
msgid "Shows archived agents so you can restore them."
msgstr "संग्रहित एजेंट दिखाता है ताकि आप उन्हें वापस ला सकें।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Agent overview” saying what it does
msgid "Shows every agent and what it is doing."
msgstr "हर एजेंट और वह क्या कर रहा है, यह दिखाता है।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Agents: all chats” saying what it does
msgid "Shows every chat in the explorer."
msgstr "एक्सप्लोरर में हर चैट दिखाता है।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Agents: unread only” saying what it does
msgid "Shows only chats with unread messages in the explorer."
msgstr "एक्सप्लोरर में सिर्फ़ नहीं पढ़े गए मैसेज वाली चैट दिखाता है।"

#. Settings page and Ctrl+K, the line under the setting “Compact explorer” saying what it does
msgid "Shows only each chat's avatar and name in the explorer."
msgstr "एक्सप्लोरर में हर चैट की सिर्फ़ प्रोफ़ाइल फ़ोटो और नाम दिखाता है।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Agents: done” saying what it does
msgid "Shows only the chats that are idle and read in the explorer."
msgstr "एक्सप्लोरर में सिर्फ़ वे चैट दिखाता है जो निष्क्रिय हैं और पढ़ी जा चुकी हैं।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Agents: needs you” saying what it does
msgid ""
"Shows only the chats waiting for you: unread, asking a question or holding a decision. Snoozed chats stay out."
msgstr ""
"सिर्फ़ वे चैट दिखाता है जो आपका इंतज़ार कर रही हैं: नहीं पढ़ी गई, कोई सवाल पूछ रही या कोई फ़ैसला रोके हुए। स्नूज़ की गई चैट इसमें नहीं आतीं।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Agents: working” saying what it does
msgid "Shows only the chats whose agent is working now in the explorer."
msgstr "एक्सप्लोरर में सिर्फ़ वे चैट दिखाता है जिनका एजेंट अभी काम कर रहा है।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Agents: snoozed” saying what it does
msgid "Shows the chats you snoozed, with when each comes back."
msgstr "आपकी स्नूज़ की गई चैट दिखाता है, साथ में यह भी कि हर चैट कब वापस आएगी।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Keys here” saying what it does
msgid ""
"Shows the keys that matter where the keyboard is, your own bindings included."
msgstr "कीबोर्ड जहां है, वहां काम की कीज़ दिखाता है, आपकी अपनी बाइंडिंग भी।"

#. chat, tooltip of the quiet line about messages between agents: clicking shows them
msgid "Shows the messages between agents in this chat"
msgstr "इस चैट में एजेंटों के बीच के मैसेज दिखाता है"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Select text” saying what it does
msgid ""
"Shows the open chat as plain text to select from with the mouse or Shift+arrows and copy with Ctrl+C; a message's own select icon shows just that message."
msgstr ""
"खुली चैट को सादे टेक्स्ट के रूप में दिखाता है, ताकि आप माउस या Shift+तीर कीज़ से चुनकर Ctrl+C से कॉपी कर सकें; किसी मैसेज का अपना चुनने वाला आइकन सिर्फ़ वही मैसेज दिखाता है।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Conversation or Session view” saying what it does
msgid ""
"Shows the open chat the other way: Conversation (your messages, the replies, cards; the work behind Show work) or Session (everything as it ran). On a Host that offers it."
msgstr ""
"खुली चैट को दूसरे तरीके से दिखाता है: बातचीत (आपके मैसेज, जवाब, कार्ड; काम 'काम दिखाएं' के पीछे) या सेशन (सब कुछ जैसे चला)। उस Host पर जो यह सुविधा देता है।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Agent conversations (agent to agent)” saying what it does
msgid "Shows the rooms where agents talk to each other."
msgstr "वे रूम दिखाता है जहां एजेंट आपस में बात करते हैं।"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, the line under the command “Background processes” saying what it does
msgid ""
"Shows the selected agent's background jobs and running helpers: open a job's output, stop a job or a helper. On Updates, every job."
msgstr ""
"चुने गए एजेंट के बैकग्राउंड जॉब और चल रहे सहायक दिखाता है: किसी जॉब का आउटपुट खोलें, कोई जॉब या सहायक रोकें। अपडेट पेज पर, हर जॉब।"

#. Settings > Experiments, the line describing the Tool detail level "Grandma"
#. Settings > Experiments, tool explanations at the Grandma level: what it shows
msgid "Simple explanations, no technical terms."
msgstr "आसान व्याख्या, कोई तकनीकी शब्द नहीं।"

#. countdown card, label above the time passed since the target
msgid "Since target"
msgstr "तय समय के बाद से"

#. Settings page and Ctrl+K, the line under the preference “Heading size” saying what it does.
msgid ""
"Size of a message's top-level headings relative to its text (smaller headings follow)"
msgstr ""
"टेक्स्ट के मुकाबले मैसेज की सबसे बड़ी हेडिंग का साइज़ (छोटी हेडिंग उसी हिसाब से)"

#. Settings page and Ctrl+K, the line under the preference “Code size” saying what it does.
msgid "Size of code blocks relative to the message text"
msgstr "मैसेज टेक्स्ट के मुकाबले कोड ब्लॉक का साइज़"

#. Settings page and Ctrl+K, the line under the preference “Interface label size” saying what it does.
msgid "Size of labels, lists, titles and bars around the chat, relative to normal"
msgstr "चैट के आसपास लेबल, सूचियों, टाइटल और बार का साइज़, सामान्य के मुकाबले"

#. Settings page and Ctrl+K, the line under the preference “Font size” saying what it does.
msgid "Size of message text in the chat, for the current reading theme"
msgstr "मौजूदा रीडिंग थीम के लिए चैट में मैसेज टेक्स्ट का साइज़"

#. Settings page and Ctrl+K, the line under the preference “Agent picture size” saying what it does.
msgid "Size of the agents' portraits in the explorer, compact rows and cards"
msgstr "एक्सप्लोरर, कॉम्पैक्ट लाइनों और कार्ड में एजेंटों के पोर्ट्रेट का साइज़"

#. Settings > Agent picture size, an option: the size's name and its size in pixels
msgid "Small · 36 px"
msgstr "छोटा · 36 px"

#. Keys (key context “Everywhere”): the name of a key's action, in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It draws the whole window one step smaller, the chats included.
msgid "Smaller"
msgstr "छोटा"

#. Ctrl+K command palette, a command's name (an action; a verb phrase is a command, a noun phrase names what it opens). What it does: Draws the whole window one step smaller, the chats included.
msgid "Smaller interface"
msgstr "छोटा इंटरफ़ेस"

#. chat's ⋯ menu, item that opens the choices to silence this chat's notifications for a while (verb)
msgid "Snooze"
msgstr "स्नूज़ करें"

#. Keys (key context “Everywhere”): the name of a key's action, in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It takes the chat out of Needs you until it gets a new message. Kept on this device.
