msgstr "स्नूज़ की गई"

#. chat list (compact), accessibility label of the snooze mark on a chat row; {} is when the snooze ends, a time such as "14:30" or the phrase "next message"
#. chat list, accessibility label of the snooze mark on a chat row; {} is when the snooze ends, a time such as "14:30" or the phrase "next message"
