#. Keys (key context “Chats”): the name of a key's action, in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It opens a second pane to the right.
#. Keys (key context “Chat”): the name of a key's action, in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It opens a second pane to the right.
