msgid "Start an idle contact"
msgstr "कोई निष्क्रिय संपर्क शुरू करें"

#. Keys (key context “Everywhere”): the name of a key's action, in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It starts one of your idle contacts in a new session.
#. Vim mode, the which-key panel: what the keys "<Space> N" do in the chat and the explorer
msgid "Start contact"
