msgstr "डायग्नोस्टिक्स कॉपी हो गया"

#. chat, failed-turn card, accessibility label of the disclosure (noun): opens the provider's raw error text
#. chat, failed-turn card, disclosure label (noun): opens the provider's raw error text
#. context: error.details
msgctxt "error.details"
msgid "Details"
msgstr "जानकारी"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (a signal from outside the Host ended the turn)
#. context: error.ended_from_outside
msgctxt "error.ended_from_outside"
msgid "Something outside Clarp ended the turn. Send the message again."
msgstr "Clarp के बाहर से किसी चीज़ ने टर्न खत्म कर दिया। मैसेज फिर से भेजें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the agent's folder is gone); {folder} is a folder path
#. context: error.folder_missing
msgctxt "error.folder_missing"
msgid ""
"This agent's folder {folder} no longer exists. Recreate it, or make a new agent in another folder."
msgstr ""
"इस एजेंट का फ़ोल्डर {folder} अब मौजूद नहीं है। उसे फिर से बनाएं, या किसी दूसरे फ़ोल्डर में नया एजेंट बनाएं।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the agent's folder is gone)
#. context: error.folder_missing_no_path
msgctxt "error.folder_missing_no_path"
msgid ""
"This agent's folder no longer exists. Recreate it, or make a new agent in another folder."
msgstr ""
"इस एजेंट का फ़ोल्डर अब मौजूद नहीं है। उसे फिर से बनाएं, या किसी दूसरे फ़ोल्डर में नया एजेंट बनाएं।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (an OpenCode free model refused outside OpenCode)
#. context: error.free_model_restricted
msgctxt "error.free_model_restricted"
msgid ""
"This free OpenCode model only runs in OpenCode's own apps. Choose another model."
msgstr ""
"यह मुफ़्त OpenCode मॉडल सिर्फ़ OpenCode के अपने ऐप्स में चलता है। कोई दूसरा मॉडल चुनें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the turn was cut off before it finished (a restart, a process that went without a word))
#. context: error.interrupted
msgctxt "error.interrupted"
msgid "The turn was cut off before it finished. Send the message again."
msgstr "टर्न पूरा होने से पहले ही रुक गया। मैसेज फिर से भेजें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the provider rejected the request as malformed (bad tool or call ids, an empty tool result, invalid payload, 400). Trying the same session again replays the same history, so the first action starts a fresh one); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.invalid_request
msgctxt "error.invalid_request"
msgid ""
"{backend} rejected the conversation history. Start a fresh session with the same conversation and try again."
msgstr ""
"{backend} ने बातचीत का इतिहास अस्वीकार कर दिया। उसी बातचीत के साथ नया सेशन शुरू करें और फिर से कोशिश करें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the agent moved to another Host)
#. context: error.moved
msgctxt "error.moved"
msgid "This agent moved to another Host. Continue the conversation there."
msgstr "यह एजेंट दूसरे Host पर चला गया है। बातचीत वहीं जारी रखें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the computer had no network for 15 minutes)
#. context: error.network_gone
msgctxt "error.network_gone"
msgid ""
"This computer had no network for 15 minutes, so the turn stopped. Try again once it is online."
msgstr ""
"इस कंप्यूटर पर 15 मिनट तक नेटवर्क नहीं था, इसलिए टर्न रुक गया। ऑनलाइन होने पर फिर से कोशिश करें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the Host could not start the turn)
#. context: error.not_started
msgctxt "error.not_started"
msgid "The Host could not start the turn. Try again."
msgstr "Host टर्न शुरू नहीं कर सका। फिर से कोशिश करें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the conversation no longer fits the model)
#. context: error.prompt_too_long
msgctxt "error.prompt_too_long"
msgid "This conversation has grown too long for the model. Compact it and continue."
msgstr "यह बातचीत मॉडल के लिए बहुत लंबी हो गई है। इसे कॉम्पैक्ट करें और जारी रखें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (overloaded, rate limited, 429/5xx after the Host's own retries); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.provider_busy
msgctxt "error.provider_busy"
msgid ""
"{backend} is overloaded right now, and the Host's retries did not get through. Try again in a minute, or switch model."
msgstr ""
"{backend} पर अभी बहुत ज़्यादा लोड है, और Host की दोबारा कोशिशें भी सफल नहीं हुईं। एक मिनट बाद फिर से कोशिश करें, या मॉडल बदलें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the model's provider is unavailable); {model} is a model name, not translated
#. context: error.provider_down
msgctxt "error.provider_down"
msgid ""
"The provider of {model} is unavailable right now. Try again later, or switch model."
msgstr ""
"{model} का प्रोवाइडर अभी उपलब्ध नहीं है। बाद में फिर से कोशिश करें, या मॉडल बदलें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the agent ran on another provider than it is bound to)
#. context: error.provider_mismatch
msgctxt "error.provider_mismatch"
msgid ""
"This agent ran on another model provider than the one it is bound to. Check its Codex home and provider."
msgstr ""
"यह एजेंट जिस मॉडल प्रोवाइडर से जुड़ा है, उसके बजाय किसी दूसरे प्रोवाइडर पर चला। इसका Codex home और प्रोवाइडर जांचें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the model refused (a safety filter blocked the answer))
#. context: error.refused
msgctxt "error.refused"
msgid ""
"The model refused to answer (a safety filter blocked it). Rephrase, or switch model."
msgstr ""
"मॉडल ने जवाब देने से मना कर दिया (सेफ़्टी फ़िल्टर ने इसे रोक दिया)। बात को दूसरे शब्दों में लिखें, या मॉडल बदलें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, badge for how many times the same failure repeated in a row; keep it short
#. context: error.repeat_count
msgctxt "error.repeat_count"
msgid "{n}×"
msgid_plural "{n}×"
msgstr[0] "{n}×"
msgstr[1] "{n}×"

#. chat, failed-turn card, note under the buttons after a scheduled retry was accepted; {time} is a time already written in the language ("18:27", "Sat 18:27")
#. context: error.retry_scheduled
msgctxt "error.retry_scheduled"
msgid "Will try again at {time}"
msgstr "{time} पर फिर से कोशिश की जाएगी"

#. chat, failed-turn card, note under the buttons after the message was sent again
#. context: error.retry_sent
msgctxt "error.retry_sent"
msgid "Sent again"
msgstr "फिर से भेजा गया"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the backend's process ended unexpectedly); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.runner_exit
msgctxt "error.runner_exit"
msgid "{backend} stopped unexpectedly. Try again."
msgstr "{backend} अचानक बंद हो गया। फिर से कोशिश करें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the backend's session is held by another process (a Codex thread with another active writer, a locked Grok session)); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.session_locked
msgctxt "error.session_locked"
msgid "The {backend} session is busy in another process. Try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"{backend} सेशन किसी दूसरी प्रोसेस में व्यस्त है। थोड़ी देर में फिर से कोशिश करें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the backend stopped responding); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.timeout
msgctxt "error.timeout"
msgid "{backend} stopped responding. Try again."
msgstr "{backend} ने जवाब देना बंद कर दिया। फिर से कोशिश करें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (anything else); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.unknown
msgctxt "error.unknown"
msgid ""
"The turn failed at {backend}. Try again, or switch model if it happens again."
msgstr ""
"{backend} पर टर्न पूरा नहीं हो सका। फिर से कोशिश करें, या दोबारा ऐसा हो तो मॉडल बदलें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the account's usage window is spent); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.usage_limit
msgctxt "error.usage_limit"
msgid "Your {backend} account is out of usage. Try again later, or switch model."
msgstr ""
"आपके {backend} खाते की इस्तेमाल की सीमा पूरी हो गई है। बाद में फिर से कोशिश करें, या मॉडल बदलें।"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the account's usage window is spent); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated; {time} is a time already written in the language ("18:27", "Sat 18:27")
#. context: error.usage_limit_until
msgctxt "error.usage_limit_until"
msgid ""
"Your {backend} account is out of usage until {time}. Try again then, or switch model."
msgstr ""
"आपके {backend} खाते की इस्तेमाल की सीमा पूरी हो गई है और {time} पर रीसेट होगी। तब फिर से कोशिश करें, या मॉडल बदलें।"

